      "modern_practice": "OSH Code 2020 and Social Security Code 2020; RTI Online Portal (rtionline.gov.in) with instant payment and digital file forwarding.",
      "transition_notes": "Official syllabus mandate specifically replaces legacy acts with the 4 Labour Codes 2020."
