      "Number Systems: Binary, Octal, Hexadecimal, 1's and 2's complement representation of negative integers",
      "IEEE 754 Floating Point: Single precision (32-bit: 1 sign + 8 exponent + 23 mantissa), Double precision (64-bit)",
      "Microprocessor Architecture: Von Neumann (shared bus/memory) vs Harvard (separate code & data memories)",
      "CPU Components: ALU, Control Unit (CU), Program Counter (PC), Instruction Register (IR), Accumulator",
